@startuml fig_lease_vs_fence
!include _style.puml
' Book figure — a lease orders ownership, a sink-side fencing token orders what the sink
' accepts, and source-generation validation consults the authoritative generation before
' publishing. Two panels plus a labelled distinction note; five lifelines (R1, R2,
' lease/token coordinator, source, cache/sink); numbered messages.
' Evidence status: conceptual illustration — it draws the mechanisms the fill-lease and
' publication-fence cards describe (v2-15) and asserts no rate.
title a lease orders ownership; a fencing token orders what the sink accepts

participant "filler R1" as R1
participant "filler R2" as R2
participant "lease / token\ncoordinator" as COORD
participant "source\n(database)" as DB
participant "cache / sink" as SINK

group 1. lease only — ownership expires, publication is not ordered
  R1 -> COORD : 1 acquire lease #7
  COORD --> R1 : lease #7
  R1 -> DB : 2 slow source read
  DB --> R1 : S0
  COORD -> COORD : 3 lease #7 expires
  R2 -> COORD : 4 acquire lease #8
  COORD --> R2 : lease #8
  R2 -> DB : 5 read
  DB --> R2 : S1 (newer)
  R2 -> SINK : 6 publish S1
  R1 -> SINK : 7 publish S0 (its lease has lapsed)
  note over R1, SINK : A lease orders ownership, not publication.\nNothing here rejects the stale publish.
end

group 2. sink-side fencing token — the sink remembers the highest accepted token
  R1 -> COORD : 1 acquire token 7
  COORD --> R1 : token 7
  R2 -> COORD : 2 acquire token 8
  COORD --> R2 : token 8
  R2 -> SINK : 3 publish (S1, token 8)
  SINK -> SINK : 4 accept; record token 8
  R1 -> SINK : 5 publish (S0, token 7)
  SINK --> R1 : 6 reject — 7 is older than 8
  note over SINK : The sink orders operations only once a newer\ntoken has reached it. If token 7 had arrived\nfirst, the sink would have accepted it.
end

note over R1, SINK
  Distinct from both: source-generation validation checks the
  authoritative source generation before publishing. R1 observed
  v0; the source now returns v1, so R1 must not publish — even
  though no token-8 operation reached the sink.
end note
@enduml
